# Scout for Survivors under Containment Priest: the two creature cards it returns were not cast, so the Priest exiles each
# instead of letting it enter (CR 614.1a). "Put a +1/+1 counter on each of them" is about the creatures that entered, and none
# did, so the cards in exile get no counter (CR 400.7). Wheel of Fortune (cast off Black Lotus) puts Llanowar Elves and
# Elvish Mystic in Bot1's graveyard and draws the Priest and Scout, each then cast off the Moxen and a Plains.

